# Screen toys: animations and effects, one stanza per program.  The
# play-tests in tools/playtests cover bite, card, life, rain, suicide and
# worms.

shot    suicide1
cap     A rooftop animation, one of three variants: the figure has
cap     jumped, and the scream runs along the top of the building.
run     suicide1
wait    6
snap
wait    2

shot    suicide2
cap     The rooftop animation's other variant, with a car.
run     suicide2
wait    6
snap
wait    2

shot    ttyexp
cap     Fireworks for a VT100: explosions of characters thrown out from
cap     a point and falling back, with options for how many at once,
cap     their size and their shape.  On this console it returns at once
cap     without drawing.
run     ttyexp -s2 -p50
wait    4
snap
wait    2
run     ttyexp -h
wait    4
